--- Select the module
set module R&W .

--- Check the invariant
check ind-invariant \
     < N:Natural , 0 > | true \
  \/ < 0 , s(0) > | true .

--- Check if the initial state is subsumed by the LHS of the rules (deadlock freedom)
check \
     < N:Natural , 0 > | true \
  \/ < 0 , s(0) > | true \
 subsumed by \
     < 0, 0 > | true \
  \/ < R:Natural, s(W:Natural) > | true \
  \/ < R:Natural, 0 > | true \
  \/ < s(R:Natural), W:Natural > | true .